CoworkingView for Calc adds spreadsheet functions for the public CoworkingView catalogue and price index.

CWV_SPACES returns how many workspace listings a city has. CWV_PRICE returns the median market rate for a product such as flex_desk or day_pass. CWV_SOURCE returns the data credit. No API key is required.

Only the city you enter is sent to api.coworkingview.com, plus the fixed locale the API requires. Spreadsheet contents are not sent.

Homepage: https://coworkingview.com
